=2 Walkthrough
* You must wait until the next game day after completing {q:The Talekeeper's Truth|The Talekeeper's Truth|The Talekeeper's Truth} before you can activate this quest.
* Speak to {n:Deidogg} in {z:Bastok Mines}.
* Speak to {n:Detzo} in {z:Bastok Mines} (I-6), located in the alleyway around the corner from Deidogg.(Speak to him again if he mentions a Mythril Sallet)
* Obtain a {i:Ginger Cookie|Ginger Cookie|4394} and trade it to {n:Deidogg}. The quest will now be flagged.
* Travel to {z:Behemoth's Dominion}.
** If you don't have the {p:Survival Guide} warp, the quickest way is via {z:Qufim Island}; follow the tunnel starting at (G-5) until you zone in.
* Proceed to (K-9) in Behemoth's Dominion to find a **???**. Touching it will spawn 3 NM goblins:
** {m:Doglix Muttsnout} (Level 58 WHM)
** {m:Moxnix Nightgoggle} (Level 58 RNG)
** {m:Picklix Longindex} (Level 60 THF)
** Be aware all 3 NMs will aggressively use {s:Bomb Toss}.
* Defeat the NMs, and zone out of Behemoth's Dominion (back into Qufim Island) to receive a cutscene and your reward.

=2 Notes
* This quest does not get flagged in your log until after you trade the {@i:Ginger Cookie|4394} {i:Ginger Cookie|Ginger Cookie|4394} to {n:Deidogg}.
* You can attempt to defeat the mobs on a non-Warrior job (as long as you have the quest).
* __(verification needed)__ The NMs can only be popped once per game day. Otherwise when touching the **???** you will get the message "It is too blurry to read".

